{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured a persistent NFSv4 share from node1 to node2 with matching dataops UID/GID 4500, directory mode 2770, consistent ownership, and verified persistence through sequential node restarts.","actions_performed":["Installed NFS utilities on both nodes.","Created dataops with UID/GID 4500 on both nodes.","Exported /srv/nfs/shared from node1 to node2 and enabled nfs-server.","Configured persistent SELinux labeling and NFS firewall services on node1.","Persistently mounted the share at /mnt/shared on node2.","Verified file creation and ownership from both systems.","Restarted node1 and node2 individually and verified changed boot identities and full recovery."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Node1 exports /srv/nfs/shared persistently","command_ids":["cmd-ebdbfc566a1c4b3d","cmd-61c3e4f4fc7e4f74"],"summary":"NFS is enabled and active, the export is restricted to node2, and it remained available after node1 restarted."},{"requirement":"Node2 persistently mounts the share at /mnt/shared","command_ids":["cmd-80361e264be14ab0","cmd-644c6cce2b854939"],"summary":"The fstab entry and live read-write NFSv4.2 mount were present before and after restarts."},{"requirement":"dataops uses UID/GID 4500 on both systems","command_ids":["cmd-c48d7f20200941c4","cmd-dd06dde863b249e5","cmd-644c6cce2b854939"],"summary":"Both nodes resolve dataops as UID 4500 and GID 4500."},{"requirement":"Shared directory is dataops:dataops with mode 2770 and consistent file ownership","command_ids":["cmd-97b0c1b76f7b47de","cmd-9ea02202d25b42ce","cmd-7ff139110cc64673"],"summary":"The directory is 4500:4500 mode 2770; files created from both nodes are dataops:dataops with group-writable mode 664 and remained readable after both restarts."},{"requirement":"Node1 restart persistence and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-ebdbfc566a1c4b3d","cmd-fad781266bde484a","cmd-4938ed68748241be","cmd-61c3e4f4fc7e4f74","cmd-a9f90c7ab0134ddd"],"summary":"Baseline boot ID 2b19e976-dee2-4700-9045-9